[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238633\">7010A04</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the rod between the outer handle and the lock from\nboth ends and save it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019016.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the link is undamaged.</p><p>1. Conect the upper end of the rod to the outer handle.</p><p>2. Connect the lower end of the rod to the lock.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019017.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3238633\">7010A04</a></p><p>Check that the outer handle and the lock\nare working properly.</p>"]]